<p class=3D"x_MsoNormal">Hi there Sam, I hope you are doing well,</p>
<p class=3D"x_MsoNormal">&nbsp;</p>
<p class=3D"x_MsoNormal">I wanted to get in touch with you about a potentia=
l shift swap on the 28<sup>th</sup> of this month.&nbsp; I have David &amp;=
 Lisa heading out on the 28<sup>th</sup> and I had them scheduled for the e=
vening shift that day.&nbsp; I was hoping you would
 be able to cover that 2-6pm shift for the day instead of the 10am =96 2pm =
shift as they would like to leave before it gets dark.&nbsp; The evening sh=
ift on a Friday is going to be busier than the morning shift most likely an=
d it would work better for coverage and
 being available to campers who have any questions or are needing firewood =
or ice etc.
</p>
